  "changes": "Declared changes only. (1) imports rewritten from top-level to package-relative; (2) the HuggingFace Hub dependency and PyTorchModelHubMixin base class removed; (3) the input channel count is a constructor argument (cfa4 builds fnet 4 / cnet 8, rgb3 builds fnet 3 / cnet 6) instead of the hard-coded 3/6; (4) ResNetFPN takes an explicit depth argument and its torchvision ImageNet branch is deleted, so model depth and pretrained-weight loading are independent and no configuration can re-enable a download; (5) the 2 * (x / 255) - 1 RGB rescale is removed from RAFT.forward, so callers must supply calibrated, normalised RAW values; (6) in utils/utils.py the scipy import is local to forward_interpolate because scipy is not a dependency of this repository and no vendored model path calls it; (7) ruff format applied (whitespace/docstring layout only). Author definitions are otherwise unchanged: compare executable_ast_sha256 per file.",
